772
01:04:59,189 --> 01:05:01,696
So a robot is a model of itself of the environment.

773
01:05:01,746 --> 01:05:08,038
This model is uncertain by construction then it has to do to deal with this uncertainty for taking decisions.

774
01:05:08,088 --> 01:05:08,494
Okay.

