01:05:37,083 --> 01:05:43,013
Okay, then you may seek strong guarantees from the us of a specific policy or controller.

784
01:05:43,063 --> 01:05:49,165
And this the problem here is that many times it is possible if you simplify your model because so you're saying I want strong guarantees but then

