01:05:49,215 --> 01:05:56,224
I have to use a simplified model and then your guarantees are not that strong you know in practice and also you have to invent many times something.

786
01:05:56,274 --> 01:06:03,069
like some quantities some of function traction metric and this is also not always possible then you want to computition

