01:06:03,119 --> 01:06:10,889
visibility and this again can be manageable only for simplified models okay and another point that I think many people uh

788
01:06:10,939 --> 01:06:19,028
take is to say my uncertainty is a generic perturbation like you know an additive process noise something like that this

789
01:06:19,078 --> 01:06:27,052
simplifies the math but then you don't have any structure and then your uncertainty prediction will be very very conservative Okay.

